The Vulkan half of 0106: the vertex buffer residency cache kept guest address and size across draws and
frames, so a fetch constant rebound at the same address and size skipped RequestRange, the only thing that
re-uploads vertex data the CPU rewrote in place (stale vertices). Residency is deduplicated within one
draw only.

